          "sent_mt": "2026-09-05T12:22:23-06:00",
          "text": "Team, today this cord floor strip was missing again. We replaced it, but this is at least the fourth time it has gone missing after being replaced. So, shift managers,  Rich Brierley Marcos Montano Phillip Perez Frederick Peairs \n\n\nUntil we can prove as a plant that we are taking our safety culture seriously enough to take care of the little things like this, each shift will post in this chat at the end of shift that this cover strip is still in place. I'll leave it up to each of you who will post (lead, supervisor, or yourselves) but this is a shiftly requirement from now on. Marcos Montano please add as a safety action in shift exchange to discuss Tuesday",
